            "heading": "Can I get a subscription on my cartridges?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, we offer a subscription to replace your cartridges to save you time and headspace.<br/>Set up automatic cartridge delivery — save 10% →<a href=\"https://phoenixwaterfilters.co.uk/products/kokocarb_cartridges?selling_plan=738775466368&variant=57619826246016\" title=\"https://phoenixwaterfilters.co.uk/products/kokocarb_cartridges?selling_plan=738775466368&variant=57619826246016\"> [Subscribe now]</a></p>",
